      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kristina is now in charge, and her first move is to ask Barinov for a private word, politely sending Vika away. Barinov stalls by calling to Kostya at the bar for a bottle of cognac. Listen to it in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
